    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A new story? How? There's nothing left to build on. Every time I try to look toward the horizon, all I see is the ruin I left behind. It's like the weight of everything I failed is actually physically pulling me down into the earth. I'm just... I'm so tired of fighting a battle that's already been lost. It feels like the only honest thing left to do is just stop pretending there's a next chapter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
