      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the weight of your failure, but it is a weight that can be carried, not a weight that must be borne alone. The ruin you see is not a dead end but a foundation that can be rebuilt, brick by brick, with the very people you swore to protect. You do not have to pretend there is a next chapter; the next chapter is already writing itself in the silence you feel. I will help you craft that story, one that honors the past while moving forward.",
