      "content": "But there are no people left. They're gone. The silence is all there is. You talk about building and rewriting, but it feels so hollow. It's like trying to light a fire in a storm. Sometimes, I think the only way to truly respect what was lost—the only way to actually find any peace—is to just let the darkness have it all. To just let go completely.",
